WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.849
After hours line.

00:01.293 --> 00:03.287
Our office is currently closed.

00:03.716 --> 00:04.625
This is Samantha.

00:05.239 --> 00:06.051
How can I help you?

00:06.350 --> 00:09.418
I would like to set up a consultation

00:09.717 --> 00:12.250
Sounds like you found the right place.

00:12.463 --> 00:16.522
Our attorneys have helped thousands
of families in your situation.

00:17.134 --> 00:20.910
I'm going to get you right over to our
scheduling assistant who can set up

00:21.210 --> 00:24.365
This is Brooke, the firm's
virtual intake assistant.

00:24.966 --> 00:26.142
How can I help you today?

00:26.441 --> 00:31.149
I'd like to schedule a consultation
May I have your first and last name?

00:31.449 --> 00:32.234
Will you be filing?

00:32.534 --> 00:33.021
Got it.

00:33.604 --> 00:37.532
Do you currently own a business or have
you owned one in the last few years?

00:37.832 --> 00:38.122
No

00:38.421 --> 00:38.864
Okay.

00:39.434 --> 00:41.528
Now let's get you a free consultation.

00:42.128 --> 00:43.779
What day and time works best for you?

00:44.315 --> 00:47.272
If you're not sure, just share
a weekday window you could step

00:47.273 --> 00:48.976
away for about forty-five minutes.

00:49.277 --> 00:49.495
Mm-hmm.

00:49.795 --> 00:52.335
That'll be every day around noon.

00:52.635 --> 00:55.311
Let me check for available
appointment slots.

00:55.896 --> 00:58.408
I have a slot on Tuesday at noon.

00:59.069 --> 01:00.547
Would you like me to book that time?

01:00.847 --> 01:01.315
Yes.

01:01.614 --> 01:03.797
Let me book the appointment for you.

01:04.096 --> 01:04.826
Perfect.

01:05.054 --> 01:07.183
One moment while I finalize that for you.

01:07.556 --> 01:10.021
You're all set for Tuesday at noon.

01:10.426 --> 01:11.270
It's on Zoom.

01:11.947 --> 01:12.672
Perfect.

01:12.880 --> 01:17.043
You're all set, you'll get the intake
form and a confirmation text shortly.

01:17.343 --> 01:20.648
Please complete it before Tuesday
so the attorney can prepare.

01:21.350 --> 01:22.959
Is there anything else I can help with?

01:23.259 --> 01:23.801
That's it.

01:23.883 --> 01:24.347
Thank you.

01:24.647 --> 01:26.080
Have a great afternoon.

01:26.380 --> 01:26.390
Thanks.

01:26.390 --> 01:26.401
Bye.
